      "writtenOn": "2024-09-18T15:02:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If in this state deactivateEphemeralKeyMode returns an error, then how does ephemeral key mode get deactivated? Will deactivateEphemeralKeyMode work if the border agent with the active session calls it, but fail if other clients call it? \n\nOr must the border agent deactivate ephemeral key mode by calling some other method? If so, which one?\n\nAlso what happens if the border agent crashes, must other callers wait until the timeout has elapsed?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 264,
        "startChar": 55,
        "endLine": 265,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "c66e8f3338560e708d75ab96287763e2944779f4",
