      },
      "lineNbr": 265,
      "author": {
        "id": 2024816
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-19T06:37:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The ephemearl key mode gets deactivated when the secure session is disconnected: 1) by the external commissioner candidate, 2) by the border agent when the ephemeral key expires, 3) when the border agent restarts.\n\nUpdated the doc, PTAL",
      "parentUuid": "bdcbfbf7_e5969b7f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 264,
        "startChar": 55,
        "endLine": 265,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "c66e8f3338560e708d75ab96287763e2944779f4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1b0f1c5d_7cb1f184",
        "filename": "thread/framework/java/android/net/thread/ThreadNetworkController.java",
        "patchSetId": 27
      },
      "lineNbr": 377,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-18T15:02:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry for not noticing this earlier, but I think this should be \"Instant expiry\" instead of \"Duration lifetime\". Rationale: the duration becomes incorrect as time passes, but the expiry doesn\u0027t. Making it an Instant makes this callback easier to implement and easier to use for the developer.\n\nIn particular, we need to consider the case where a callback is registered some time after the device is put into ephemeral key mode. If the lifetime was 10 minutes, and the callback was registered 1 minute after ephemeral key mode starts, then the key expires 9 minutes from now; if you use Duration then it should be 9 minutes, right?\n\nLooking at the implementation CL in aosp/3140438 and the tests, I\u0027m not sure this is implemented correctly. Using Instant (or internally a \"long expiry\") would make this easier.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 377,
        "startChar": 26,
        "endLine": 377,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "c66e8f3338560e708d75ab96287763e2944779f4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
